\pard\plain\kerning1\ql\li0\ri0\sl-480\slmult0\tx720\tx4752{\f0\fs24 \cf1 \f0\fs24 If you choose to depict J.\~Robert Oppenheimer on the book's cover, may I please ask you not to depict him smoking?  Yes, Oppie was a chain smoker, but I lost my younger brother to lung cancer and find such imagery disturbing (it was hard enough for me to write all the smoking Oppie does in this novel).  Many thanks!}\par
