\pard\plain\kerning1\ql\li0\ri0\sl-480\slmult0\tx720\tx4752{\f0\fs24 \cf1 In the acronym-heavy scene in which Feynman is reading the dossier on von Braun, I've deliberately left out all the periods (a) for readability and (b) because this particular real historical document rendered them that way.}\par
